  Sign in with UnieAI, or connect a model API, to use UnieAI Code

> 1. Sign in with UnieAI Rabi
     Use your Rabi account (agent.unieai.com)

  2. Sign in with UnieAI Studio
     Use your UnieAI account (studio.unieai.com)

  3. Sign in with your company's UnieAI Studio
     Enter your company or on-prem Studio URL

  4. Connect a model API (OpenAI, OpenRouter, DeepSeek, Ollama, your server…)
     Bring your own API key or server; no UnieAI account needed

  Press enter to continue
